          {"en": "She does her homework at seven.", "cn": "她七点做作业。"}
        ]},
        {"title": "频度副词的位置", "explain": "always、usually、often、never 放在实义动词前、be 动词后。", "examples": [
          {"en": "I always eat breakfast.", "cn": "我总是吃早餐。"},
          {"en": "He is never late.", "cn": "他从不迟到。"}
        ]}
      ],
      "tips": ["读时间的常用说法：7:30 = seven thirty 或 half past seven。"]
